  "design": {
    "idea": "Stepped Mute Organ Loft: hush the Choir Gloams & Clerk with Dusk Bell, lower the two pipe shutters with Dawn & War Bells (also cracking the NE pipe for Moth 06!), strike the 4 Sequence Orbs in chord order 2-4-1-3, and drop down the SW chute directly beside the Narthex Boss Gate!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "3-bell acoustic puzzle + 4-orb sequence_orbs chord + Cycle 3 chute return; sold:music_off/sound_off/fps_step opens SE vault.",
    "decisions": 9,
    "expert_s": 55,
    "reward": "chute_short+moth_8_06",
    "why": "Beauty Wing finale (music_off + sound_off + fps_step), looping back cleanly to the Boss Counter.",
